@startuml
title TARGET Mobile offline sale - durabilidad local
actor Owner
participant Mobile
participant "Shared Application / Domain" as domain
database SQLite
participant API
Owner -> Mobile : Vende sin Internet
Mobile -> domain : Calcula snapshots locales
domain --> Mobile : Operacion/estado exactos
Mobile -> SQLite : BEGIN / Sale + Items + Movements + State + Outbox
Mobile -> SQLite : COMMIT
Mobile --> Owner : Guardado local, pendiente sync
... Internet disponible ...
Mobile -> API : Push command estable y snapshot esperado
alt Costo compatible/producto activo
  API --> Mobile : ACCEPTED + estado compartido
  Mobile -> SQLite : Replica/receipt/pending atomicos
else Costo cambio
  API --> Mobile : CONFLICT sin writes financieros
  Mobile -> SQLite : Preservar propuesta para revision
end
@enduml
